"""Long-form article — Best Trailer Hitches for 2023–2026 Honda Pilot (4th gen).
Mirrors the approved pilot (ford_f150_2021_tonneau.py). No invented hands-on testing: tow ratings and TrailSport
equipment come from Honda (hondanews press kit, Honda Info Center); hitch ratings from Draw-Tite and CURT product
pages in SOURCES (checked 2026-09-24). Amazon picks chosen by listing title naming the 2023+ Pilot.
Angle: TrailSport already has a hitch; everyone else chooses between Honda's dealer-installed accessory and an
aftermarket hitch, and FWD vs AWD sets the real limit (3,500 vs 5,000 lb).
"""

